りが激しく、褒められるのが苦手だが、自分も友達もいつも笑顔でいる。\n\nGoogle Driveに両キャラクターのリファレンスシートとハグのリファレンス画像を掲載しています。https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GV-F2LCXOA1_Wq-hnoC-aLzeSRPH6ORe?usp=sharing\n\nお時間をいただき、ありがとうございました。^^", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mokou_cooking/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7f776de0/uploads/origins/190e33bf-0c05-4cec-bab4-e7e26ccbe750?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1c7a18b368a694290fc3208330cf557a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7f776de0/uploads/origins/190e33bf-0c05-4cec-bab4-e7e26ccbe750?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1c7a18b368a694290fc3208330cf557a, https://si.imgix.net/7f776de0/uploads/origins/190e33bf-0c05-4cec-bab4-e7e26ccbe750?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=39a4d5c6c027112fd7252f97c3685b8c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7f776de0/uploads/origins/190e33bf-0c05-4cec-bab4-e7e26ccbe750?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2c77d38dcb79dc996cf8c25c33f5ca74 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2398551, "client_id": 2135661, "nc": 129}, {"path": "/@mokou_cooking/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2af31ca6/uploads/origins/6a378994-cca8-420e-b9f8-dc440ea54f96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6ca4659cf1d4a6d942a7b6b116a3df96"